WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
{TS 3:02}High School Division   Twelfth Grade   Kashima Sonora
{TS 3:02}High School Division   Tenth Grade   Yamato Yura

00:00:14.180 --> 00:00:18.980
<i>I thought it was distant and had no relation to me.</i>

00:00:20.040 --> 00:00:24.780
<i>Just then I stepped into that world.</i>

00:00:25.720 --> 00:00:29.000
Stella Girls' Academy Entrance.

00:00:31.560 --> 00:00:33.330
Stella Girls' Academy Entrance.

00:01:29.360 --> 00:01:31.150
Wow.

00:01:32.900 --> 00:01:36.650
<i>Mom... Dad... Thank you.</i>

00:01:37.760 --> 00:01:40.510
<i>I'm glad I studied so hard for the entrance exams.</i>

00:01:40.510 --> 00:01:45.570
<i>Maybe I can change a little here!</i>

00:01:45.570 --> 00:01:46.860
Excuse me...

00:01:48.600 --> 00:01:50.950
Do you know where the girls' dorm is?

00:01:54.540 --> 00:01:55.970
You just enrolled too, right?

00:01:57.450 --> 00:01:58.220
Yeah...

00:01:59.960 --> 00:02:01.220
The dorm's that way.

00:02:02.010 --> 00:02:03.970
I see.

00:02:04.520 --> 00:02:06.790
Thank you.

00:02:07.750 --> 00:02:08.720
No need to be so formal.

00:02:08.720 --> 00:02:10.950
I've just been here since middle school.

00:02:10.950 --> 00:02:13.190
Just head straight and then turn right.

00:02:13.190 --> 00:02:15.370
Hey, show me around school.

00:02:15.370 --> 00:02:17.150
What about the dorm?

00:02:17.150 --> 00:02:18.950
I know the way now. I'll go there later.

00:02:19.720 --> 00:02:21.590
What's your name?

00:02:21.590 --> 00:02:22.730
Mine's Nao.

00:02:22.730 --> 00:02:23.520
What's yours?

00:02:23.520 --> 00:02:25.440
I'm Kaori. Nice to meet you.

00:02:25.440 --> 00:02:26.550
Nice to meet you.

00:02:38.210 --> 00:02:39.710
Hey there.

00:02:42.130 --> 00:02:44.070
You're Yamato Yura, right?

00:02:45.400 --> 00:02:47.220
Hello.

00:02:47.780 --> 00:02:52.150
Your roommate will be Kashima Sonora, a twelfth grader.

00:02:53.040 --> 00:02:57.150
She's visiting her family right now, but she should be back soon.

00:02:57.530 --> 00:02:59.340
Be friends, okay?

00:02:59.340 --> 00:03:00.320
Okay.

00:03:00.320 --> 00:03:03.010
In here.

00:03:02.070 --> 00:03:02.110
High School Division   Twelfth Grade   Kashima Sonora

00:03:02.070 --> 00:03:02.110
High School Division    Tenth Grade      Yamato Yura

00:03:07.460 --> 00:03:10.580
Wow! Everything about this school's <i>so</i> fancy!

00:03:11.060 --> 00:03:13.010
Even the dorm rooms are huge!

00:03:15.830 --> 00:03:19.880
This will be my room from now.

00:03:24.370 --> 00:03:27.390
I guess that's Kashima Sonora...

00:03:27.960 --> 00:03:30.520
I hope she's nice.

00:03:30.520 --> 00:03:35.480
I wonder if there'll be anything like a Sœur oath.

00:03:56.920 --> 00:04:01.220
STELLA GIRLS' ACADEMY

00:03:56.920 --> 00:04:01.220
HIGH SCHOOL DIVISION C CLUB

00:04:01.680 --> 00:04:04.580
I decided this myself

00:04:04.580 --> 00:04:07.590
I decided that relying on chance

00:04:07.590 --> 00:04:13.100
is just so ridiculously fruitless

00:04:13.420 --> 00:04:18.070
I dwelled in my fantasies too much

00:04:18.070 --> 00:04:24.040
I'm going to leave my safety zone behind

00:04:24.040 --> 00:04:28.910
The future is opening up to me like a vast river

00:04:28.910 --> 00:04:33.210
Even if sailing straight is difficult,

00:04:33.210 --> 00:04:36.540
I will hold my head high

00:04:37.420 --> 00:04:40.200
I'll change my life,

00:04:40.200 --> 00:04:43.240
and the gray rules that govern it

00:04:43.240 --> 00:04:49.100
even if I trip and stumble on the way

00:04:49.100 --> 00:04:54.980
Others are guiding me, but I will walk

00:04:54.980 --> 00:05:01.940
My footprints in this world are so colorful

00:05:21.250 --> 00:05:25.300
Is there no prospective soldier!?

00:05:22.380 --> 00:05:25.300
Very well, let us begin the
strategy meeting.

00:05:25.300 --> 00:05:29.280
The C3 club has suffered several sub-par recruitment drives,

00:05:29.280 --> 00:05:32.720
and we are woefully under strength.

00:05:33.650 --> 00:05:37.860
We direly need to recruit new personnel this year.

00:05:39.670 --> 00:05:42.440
Let us think of a strategy for the induction of new recruits!

00:05:43.690 --> 00:05:46.030
"Strategy for the induction of new recruits"?

00:05:46.940 --> 00:05:49.530
Can't we postpone this until the term starts?

00:05:50.040 --> 00:05:52.310
It'll be too late by then.

00:05:52.310 --> 00:05:55.370
Do you make your strategies on the battlefield too?

00:05:55.370 --> 00:06:00.170
Not many girls are into mock battles anyway.

00:06:00.170 --> 00:06:02.310
Society thinks we're oddballs.

00:06:02.310 --> 00:06:05.760
We ourselves think we're weirdos!

00:06:06.430 --> 00:06:08.380
Neither is appealing.

00:06:08.830 --> 00:06:12.550
If they only tried it, they'd see it's fun.

00:06:12.550 --> 00:06:17.180
I guess war games just aren't for everyone.

00:06:17.180 --> 00:06:20.140
Society views airsoft guns with suspicion too.

00:06:24.760 --> 00:06:27.440
But it's so much fun!

00:06:27.440 --> 00:06:29.030
Fun, you say?

00:06:34.440 --> 00:06:35.780
You're wrong.

00:06:35.780 --> 00:06:37.040
It's ecstatic!

00:06:37.960 --> 00:06:39.370
Oddball.

00:06:39.370 --> 00:06:41.290
Weirdo.

00:06:43.600 --> 00:06:47.090
Maybe it's a prop?

00:06:47.690 --> 00:06:51.560
Maybe Sonora's in the drama or film club?

00:06:52.440 --> 00:06:55.060
Yeah, there are a lot of movies!

00:06:55.060 --> 00:06:58.020
Maybe there are more props.

00:07:02.800 --> 00:07:06.360
Not many different genres, it seems.

00:07:11.890 --> 00:07:17.160
Newly enrolled students who haven't picked a club yet

00:07:17.160 --> 00:07:21.580
tend to get press-ganged by the first club that takes them along.

00:07:21.580 --> 00:07:25.300
So the battle right after the entrance ceremony?

00:07:25.300 --> 00:07:28.960
Yeah, but the popular clubs are going to lay siege to the main hall.

00:07:28.960 --> 00:07:37.300
We will deploy our squad to protect them and establish a fortified perimeter.

00:07:31.180 --> 00:07:31.220
Soccer

00:07:37.300 --> 00:07:41.350
I'll back you up as a sniper from afar, then.

00:07:41.350 --> 00:07:45.860
New Student

00:07:41.350 --> 00:07:45.860
Rento and I will disrupt the enemy and deter them from any recruitment attempts.

00:07:45.860 --> 00:07:48.320
New Student

00:07:45.860 --> 00:07:50.320
Then I will attack the enemy and annihilate them.

00:07:51.600 --> 00:07:54.770
All the new students will crowd our clubroom!

00:07:55.320 --> 00:07:58.040
Gee, that'd be nice.

00:07:59.160 --> 00:08:01.870
The teachers would get mad if we heckle civilians.

00:08:01.870 --> 00:08:05.710
Are there really no new students interested in mock battles?

00:08:05.710 --> 00:08:08.750
They'd have to be oddballs.

00:08:08.750 --> 00:08:10.920
Weirdos, even.

00:08:11.680 --> 00:08:13.220
I'm out.

00:08:13.540 --> 00:08:16.100
Thinking about this won't get us anywhere.

00:08:16.100 --> 00:08:18.060
Let's have a match to lighten the mood!

00:08:18.060 --> 00:08:19.790
All right!

00:08:19.790 --> 00:08:21.560
What kind of setting do you want?

00:08:21.560 --> 00:08:22.680
How about a Rambo-style battle?!

00:08:22.680 --> 00:08:25.860
I want an M60 then.

00:08:25.860 --> 00:08:28.430
Rento, can you go and borrow Sono's M60 for me?

00:08:28.430 --> 00:08:30.360
You got it!

00:08:34.790 --> 00:08:36.910
Rambo

00:08:38.640 --> 00:08:40.370
Boom!

00:08:40.370 --> 00:08:41.390
Are you okay?

00:08:41.390 --> 00:08:44.710
Leave me! Go!

00:08:44.710 --> 00:08:48.600
Like hell I'd leave you here! Get up!

00:08:48.600 --> 00:08:50.070
Oh, no!

00:08:50.070 --> 00:08:53.260
Don't die, Mitchell! Mitchell!

00:08:55.970 --> 00:08:57.970
It's not what it looks like!

00:08:57.970 --> 00:08:59.600
You're an oddball!

00:08:59.600 --> 00:09:00.930
I'm not!

00:09:00.930 --> 00:09:02.560
I found an oddball!

00:09:02.560 --> 00:09:04.600
No, wait!

00:09:04.600 --> 00:09:07.150
A real weirdo!

00:09:07.150 --> 00:09:11.400
I'm not, Jesus!

00:09:12.840 --> 00:09:14.110
A new student?

00:09:14.110 --> 00:09:16.250
Sono's roommate?

00:09:16.250 --> 00:09:17.970
Got a club yet?

00:09:18.940 --> 00:09:23.830
Um, I'm Yamato Yura.

00:09:24.720 --> 00:09:25.870
Um...

00:09:25.870 --> 00:09:27.500
Let's cut to the chase.

00:09:28.320 --> 00:09:30.630
Want to join the C3 club, Li'l Yura?

00:09:30.630 --> 00:09:31.750
<i>Li'l Yura?</i>

00:09:31.750 --> 00:09:34.460
How about some tea first, Yurara?

00:09:34.460 --> 00:09:35.380
<i>Yurara?</i>

00:09:35.380 --> 00:09:37.840
We've got candy too, Yuracchi.

00:09:37.840 --> 00:09:38.880
<i>Yuracchi?</i>

00:09:39.660 --> 00:09:43.130
<i>I don't think they're really trying to remember my actual name.</i>

00:09:43.700 --> 00:09:45.350
Today we have cake, too,

00:09:46.670 --> 00:09:47.820
Yura.

00:09:48.410 --> 00:09:50.580
<i>She used my name!</i>

00:09:50.580 --> 00:09:51.360
Thank you!

00:09:52.100 --> 00:09:53.900
The cake did it.

00:09:53.900 --> 00:09:55.640
She's a calculating one.

00:09:55.640 --> 00:09:57.500
She's easy to understand.

00:09:57.500 --> 00:09:59.360
Don't hold back, Li'l Yura.

00:09:59.360 --> 00:10:00.910
This is also a part of our club's activities.

00:10:01.360 --> 00:10:03.410
Your club activities?

00:10:03.410 --> 00:10:08.170
<i>I see. They just drink tea and do nothing actually club-related.</i>

00:10:08.970 --> 00:10:16.170
<i>But here in the club I can be surrounded by beautiful seniors and drink tea every day...</i>

00:10:16.530 --> 00:10:18.800
That's be so nice!

00:10:19.200 --> 00:10:21.560
All right, let us explain, then.

00:10:21.560 --> 00:10:25.680
The C3 club is, simply put, about mock battles!

00:10:26.210 --> 00:10:27.810
Mock battles?

00:10:27.810 --> 00:10:29.780
That's what it is.

00:10:29.780 --> 00:10:31.480
It's a bit like war games.

00:10:31.480 --> 00:10:32.480
War?

00:10:33.040 --> 00:10:35.170
We shoot each other with airsoft guns.

00:10:35.170 --> 00:10:36.150
Shoot each other?

00:10:36.150 --> 00:10:39.610
And everyone who gets shot is dead!

00:10:39.610 --> 00:10:40.860
Dead?

00:10:41.310 --> 00:10:45.620
Let's have a nice battle together, Yurara!

00:10:45.620 --> 00:10:48.790
<i>These people are crazy!</i>

00:10:56.000 --> 00:10:57.840
Where did we go wrong?

00:10:58.240 --> 00:11:00.470
You were too pushy, Kari.

00:11:00.470 --> 00:11:02.180
Now it's my fault?

00:11:02.180 --> 00:11:05.180
She was such a promising weirdo.

00:11:05.180 --> 00:11:08.830
We couldn't make her see the fun of mock battles!

00:11:08.830 --> 00:11:11.960
Your gun goes bam and the bullets whiz past and you run around.

00:11:11.960 --> 00:11:15.180
It hits you and you drop like a sack of rice.

00:11:15.180 --> 00:11:17.190
It feels so good!

00:11:17.190 --> 00:11:19.840
Yeah, I didn't understand that either.

00:11:19.840 --> 00:11:22.870
Well, that's water under the bridge.

00:11:22.870 --> 00:11:25.900
Let's try our luck elsewhere.

00:11:25.900 --> 00:11:28.960
Want to think of a strategy for the entrance ceremony?

00:11:30.770 --> 00:11:31.530
Yeah.

00:11:32.500 --> 00:11:35.220
Those were some weird girls.

00:11:35.220 --> 00:11:39.010
But war games really aren't for girls...

00:11:40.040 --> 00:11:42.430
Check it out, you're my roommate.

00:11:42.430 --> 00:11:44.800
Teach me a lot about the campus, please.

00:11:44.800 --> 00:11:45.860
Sure thing.

00:11:46.510 --> 00:11:48.720
Oh, you're the girl from earlier.

00:11:49.050 --> 00:11:50.520
Hi!

00:11:50.520 --> 00:11:52.520
Did you find the dorms quickly?

00:11:52.520 --> 00:11:54.810
Yeah! My room too!

00:11:54.810 --> 00:11:56.690
I'm in Kashima's room over th—

00:11:55.540 --> 00:11:56.690
Nakamura, there's a delivery for you.

00:11:56.690 --> 00:11:57.070
Nakamura, there's a delivery for you.

00:11:57.070 --> 00:11:59.440
Nakamura, there's a delivery for you.

00:11:59.440 --> 00:12:00.810
Okay!

00:12:00.810 --> 00:12:01.950
Your belongings?

00:12:01.950 --> 00:12:02.470
Yeah.

00:12:02.470 --> 00:12:03.340
Lemme help you.

00:12:03.340 --> 00:12:04.680
Thanks.

00:12:04.680 --> 00:12:06.680
I wanna sneak a peek inside.

00:12:06.680 --> 00:12:08.000
Come on...

00:12:08.000 --> 00:12:10.210
There's nothing unusual in there.

00:12:10.990 --> 00:12:13.110
She's already made a friend.

00:12:17.160 --> 00:12:20.210
<i>They're all so open.</i>

00:12:20.210 --> 00:12:21.720
<i>Makes sense, I guess.</i>

00:12:21.720 --> 00:12:25.720
It's a new environment.

00:12:28.440 --> 00:12:33.560
<i>I've always looked up to people who stood out among their friends.</i>

00:12:35.690 --> 00:12:42.490
<i>The sort who live by their own rules and are still accepted by those around them.</i>

00:12:44.300 --> 00:12:48.050
<i>What do you have to do to be like that?</i>

00:12:50.290 --> 00:12:52.510
<i>I don't think I could do it.</i>

00:12:52.510 --> 00:12:55.500
<i>I'm afraid of dealing with large groups of people.</i>

00:12:55.990 --> 00:12:59.180
<i>That's the star I was born under.</i>

00:12:59.920 --> 00:13:00.920
<i>I'm sure...</i>

00:13:12.360 --> 00:13:14.220
Don't cry...

00:13:14.220 --> 00:13:17.340
I wanted to make high school the time of my life!

00:13:17.340 --> 00:13:23.440
But at this rate the time of my life'll be postponed until judgment day!

00:13:31.160 --> 00:13:33.350
That's so creepy!

00:13:37.500 --> 00:13:40.170
Come on, Nao.

00:13:40.170 --> 00:13:42.920
Gonna look forward to our time!

00:13:42.920 --> 00:13:45.180
Wanna sleep over here?

00:13:45.180 --> 00:13:47.050
Don't make a pass at my girl.

00:13:47.520 --> 00:13:49.800
Come on, don't be jealous.

00:13:49.800 --> 00:13:52.180
Hey, she grinds her teeth at night.

00:13:52.180 --> 00:13:54.950
Whoa, maybe I should get a different room.

00:13:54.950 --> 00:13:56.660
I don't do that!

00:14:05.640 --> 00:14:07.280
Huh?

00:14:07.780 --> 00:14:09.120
Did someone leave this here?

00:14:09.780 --> 00:14:12.280
What now? Should I wrap i—

00:14:12.800 --> 00:14:15.040
Caught you!

00:14:17.630 --> 00:14:22.070
I didn't fail to notice that you only responded to cake.

00:14:22.420 --> 00:14:26.210
So I left it out as bait!

00:14:26.800 --> 00:14:30.480
That was my plan to lure you in!

00:14:30.480 --> 00:14:33.730
I wasn't lured anywhere.

00:14:33.730 --> 00:14:35.270
Do you have something to wra—

00:14:35.270 --> 00:14:36.690
Yura.

00:14:37.740 --> 00:14:40.920
Would you please try out our mock battles, even if it's just once?

00:14:40.920 --> 00:14:44.980
I know you'll like it!

00:14:45.540 --> 00:14:46.780
Please!

00:14:46.780 --> 00:14:48.620
Did you like it?

00:14:48.620 --> 00:14:50.010
It was super delicious!

00:14:50.010 --> 00:14:50.820
So soft!

00:14:50.820 --> 00:14:53.790
Okay, I guess.

00:14:53.790 --> 00:14:55.620
If you insist.

00:14:55.620 --> 00:14:57.540
Really?

00:14:57.540 --> 00:14:59.160
Thank you!

00:14:59.160 --> 00:15:02.290
You're a weirdo, Yura, so I'm sure you'll enjoy it!

00:15:02.900 --> 00:15:04.910
<i>What's wrong with her?</i>

00:15:07.680 --> 00:15:11.310
We have a special guest today!

00:15:12.750 --> 00:15:15.060
Make her feel welcome!

00:15:15.610 --> 00:15:17.470
Hello.

00:15:19.520 --> 00:15:22.400
Welcome, Yurara.

00:15:22.400 --> 00:15:25.070
Nice to have you, Yuracchi.

00:15:25.070 --> 00:15:27.910
Have fun, Li'l Yura.

00:15:27.910 --> 00:15:29.780
Let's get started, Bunnyura.

00:15:29.780 --> 00:15:31.240
Bunnyura?

00:15:31.240 --> 00:15:34.030
So nobody's going to use my name properly after all.

00:15:34.030 --> 00:15:37.220
All right, today's game will be a Rambo-style battle.

00:15:34.080 --> 00:15:49.460
Mock Battles

00:15:34.080 --> 00:15:49.460
Japanese

00:15:37.220 --> 00:15:42.580
The Sheriff team will hunt the lone Rambo.

00:15:42.580 --> 00:15:45.810
If Rambo is hit, he loses.

00:15:45.810 --> 00:15:49.460
If all the Sheriffs are hit, Rambo wins.

00:15:50.090 --> 00:15:52.090
Four against one?

00:15:52.090 --> 00:15:54.450
That doesn't sound very fair.

00:15:54.450 --> 00:15:55.930
Rambo gets a handicap.

00:15:55.980 --> 00:16:07.440
Mock Battles

00:15:55.980 --> 00:16:07.440
Japanese

00:15:56.490 --> 00:16:02.670
She can use a machine gun, but the Sheriffs are restricted to hand guns.

00:16:02.670 --> 00:16:07.440
Because we have a beginner today, they're allowed to use wireless communication.

00:16:07.440 --> 00:16:10.320
You're together with Rento and Yachiyo, Yurara.

00:16:10.320 --> 00:16:12.610
Also Honoka.

00:16:12.610 --> 00:16:15.500
You're the Sheriffs.

00:16:15.500 --> 00:16:17.830
Karira's going to be Rambo.

00:16:17.830 --> 00:16:21.200
All right! You're gonna get knifed!

00:16:21.200 --> 00:16:25.070
No! That's too dangerous with Yurara here.

00:16:27.500 --> 00:16:29.300
Fine. Here's your knife.

00:16:31.680 --> 00:16:34.270
Getting hit with this counts too.

00:16:34.840 --> 00:16:36.090
Work up your courage, Li'l Yura.

00:16:46.380 --> 00:16:48.380
I'll explain the rules again.

00:16:48.380 --> 00:16:52.700
When you get hit by a bullet, you have to say "hit" out loud, and leave the field.

00:16:52.700 --> 00:16:57.150
Even your own bullets and ricochets count as hits.

00:16:57.150 --> 00:17:01.370
Make sure not to take off your goggles until you've reached the safe zone.

00:17:02.420 --> 00:17:03.500
Got it.

00:17:18.390 --> 00:17:19.970
Go, Yurara!

00:17:21.240 --> 00:17:22.100
Okay.

00:17:22.100 --> 00:17:24.850
Keep your voice down. She's gonna find you.

00:17:25.920 --> 00:17:26.850
Okay.

00:17:30.350 --> 00:17:31.860
Get into some cover.

00:17:32.840 --> 00:17:35.110
Don't let her hear your footsteps.

00:17:50.510 --> 00:17:51.700
Rento?

00:17:53.640 --> 00:17:54.990
Where are you?

00:17:54.990 --> 00:17:57.520
It's okay. I can see you.

00:17:57.520 --> 00:18:00.500
Fan out so we can press in on her.

00:18:00.500 --> 00:18:04.970
Kari's machine gun is powerful, but also heavy and clunky.

00:18:04.970 --> 00:18:06.760
That's her weak spot.

00:18:08.650 --> 00:18:09.400
There she is!

00:18:11.130 --> 00:18:14.220
She's aiming in your direction, Ren. Careful.

00:18:14.220 --> 00:18:15.450
Okay.

00:18:16.280 --> 00:18:18.780
I'll flank her.

00:18:28.500 --> 00:18:29.500
Damn!

00:18:35.870 --> 00:18:37.340
Hit!

00:18:37.340 --> 00:18:38.140
Yaccha!

00:18:38.140 --> 00:18:39.300
Damn. Move.

00:18:39.300 --> 00:18:41.460
She's broken out.

00:18:41.460 --> 00:18:42.220
What?

00:18:49.690 --> 00:18:51.810
She dropped the M60 and is retreating!

00:18:52.530 --> 00:18:54.770
I thought she was slow and her gun heavy.

00:18:56.290 --> 00:18:57.880
Now she's fast.

00:19:00.840 --> 00:19:01.660
Rento!

00:19:01.660 --> 00:19:02.910
On the ground, Bunnyura!

00:19:30.520 --> 00:19:32.030
Um...

00:20:25.450 --> 00:20:26.810
Wow...

00:20:35.170 --> 00:20:36.420
We can do it!

00:20:36.420 --> 00:20:37.840
Prepare yourself!

00:20:38.840 --> 00:20:39.840
Oh, no!

00:20:40.760 --> 00:20:42.090
Didn't she drop it?!

00:20:49.390 --> 00:20:50.830
Hit.

00:21:29.930 --> 00:21:32.680
<i>It was a new world.</i>

00:21:33.800 --> 00:21:37.690
<i>I thought it was distant and had no relation to me.</i>

00:21:38.410 --> 00:21:42.690
<i>Just then I stepped into that world.</i>

00:21:52.000 --> 00:21:53.380
Nicht schlecht.

00:22:10.100 --> 00:22:11.000
Command!

00:22:11.680 --> 00:22:12.880
Control!

00:22:13.340 --> 00:22:15.130
Communication!

00:22:15.130 --> 00:22:16.200
The C3 Club!

00:22:16.200 --> 00:22:16.700
Yay!

00:22:16.700 --> 00:22:20.020
Survival doesn't make the gunshots stop

00:22:20.020 --> 00:22:23.380
Carrying the flag I hear gunfire

00:22:23.380 --> 00:22:28.480
Smile, 'cause isn't this fun?

00:22:28.480 --> 00:22:30.560
Yay!

00:22:31.720 --> 00:22:36.730
I blush when I make eye contact with my comrade,

00:22:36.730 --> 00:22:38.540
but that's fine

00:22:38.540 --> 00:22:41.670
Let's trust each other and laugh

00:22:41.670 --> 00:22:42.660
Ready?

00:22:43.230 --> 00:22:45.180
3, 2, 1, go! Go!

00:22:45.180 --> 00:22:48.210
Take your comrade and get the flag!

00:22:48.210 --> 00:22:51.930
Can't you feel your heart thump when you advance?

00:22:51.930 --> 00:22:55.010
Let's hit them and laugh

00:22:55.010 --> 00:22:55.920
All right?

00:22:56.590 --> 00:22:58.560
3, 2, 1, go! Go!

00:22:58.560 --> 00:23:01.890
It can be hard, it can be vexing,

00:23:01.890 --> 00:23:04.720
but when you overcome that

00:23:05.040 --> 00:23:11.830
you'll smile like you never did before

00:23:11.830 --> 00:23:13.550
Everyone, take up positions!

00:23:13.550 --> 00:23:14.070
Okay!

00:23:15.060 --> 00:23:18.360
Survival doesn't make the gunshots stop

00:23:18.360 --> 00:23:21.690
Carrying the flag I hear gunfire

00:23:21.690 --> 00:23:27.100
Enjoy your youth, even if your tears are stolen

00:23:28.320 --> 00:23:31.800
Telepathy, a step forward

00:23:31.800 --> 00:23:34.870
Don't look down, look ahead

00:23:34.870 --> 00:23:39.290
Sorry it took me so long to be enthusiastic about it!

00:23:39.810 --> 00:24:09.630
Preview

00:23:40.190 --> 00:23:43.980
Was that really your first time in a mock battle, Yurara?

00:23:43.980 --> 00:23:45.560
Yeah, it was.

00:23:45.560 --> 00:23:48.040
So you were a battle virgin, huh?

00:23:48.040 --> 00:23:49.380
Guess so.

00:23:49.380 --> 00:23:52.240
And you jumped around with a gun in your
room even though it was your first time?

00:23:52.240 --> 00:23:53.480
You're such a weirdo.

00:23:53.480 --> 00:23:54.800
A virgin and a weirdo.

00:23:54.800 --> 00:23:56.920
That sounds wrong.

00:23:56.920 --> 00:23:58.120
Don't worry.

00:23:58.120 --> 00:24:02.150
Soon you'll meet a weirdo who outstrips you.

00:24:02.830 --> 00:24:09.630
I shall be your guard.

00:24:02.850 --> 00:24:03.410
Next episode.

00:24:03.410 --> 00:24:05.660
I shall be your guard.

00:24:05.660 --> 00:24:08.170
Meet the real weirdo!
